# SP with a letter (E-364 section 13): "If, for example, the variable u has the
# value 15, when the instruction SP u, is reached ... this instruction will
# have the effect of SP 15,". Here u chooses one of three equations, and each
# sends control back with SP r. The equation number in u is rounded like an
# index, so u = 11.2 goes to equation 11.
    r = 20,
    u = 11.2,
    SP u,
20  u = 12,
    r = 21,
    SP u,
21  u = 13,
    r = 22,
    SP u,
11  PRINT u.
    SP r,
12  PRINT u.
    SP r,
13  PRINT u.
    SP r,
22  STOP
